                                                "sense_id": "540b1e78-035a-37e2-b435-29ecdef107d1",
                                                "text": "Domestic spanking is often endured over the knee (or lap), formal spanking rather applied over a contraption such as a trestle or A-frame, with or without constraints."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b27ed36f-e5a8-3bc4-ba8a-888653020b52",
